  "step_3": "The decision reason requires evaluating all outcomes in terms of their difference from a reference value (here, zero) and computing a probability-weighted mean of these differences. The individual does not mention any reference value, nor do they discuss differences from a reference point. They do not consider all outcomes of both lotteries systematically. Instead, they focus only on the highest gain and misstate the probabilities. There is no evidence of computing or comparing mean differences. The justification is more consistent with a 'maximax' heuristic (choosing the option with the best possible outcome) than with the given decision reason. Therefore, the information considered and the justification do not align with the decision reason.",
